title: 'Consequence: from the root authors'' perspective, roots are still not substituted.'
pid: 3a6ddbba-a5a8-4ffc-a174-5310e4ed2e6c
body: |2-
  A fresh view shows the node asked for, raw, and an overridden node
  shown raw shows its own children raw, one level. Only another
  perspective replaces a root (above).
